<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to levy a contribution in relation to the
development of certain land within the Sydney region; and for purposes
connected therewith.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12885b1f-1ca3-42ec-b387-cec7679cc2f7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_e6a7f271-6225-462f-a557-3b7856dcabe8"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act and construction</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1970-024" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Land Development Contribution Act 1970</i></name></legref>,
and shall be read and construed with the <legref refid="act-1970-022"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Land
Development Contribution Management Act 1970</i></name></legref>, which in
this Act is referred to as the Principal Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3023d01c-3491-49f2-aa3c-0228d2f14b9a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_a9749de0-8a52-4b97-bde6-ab49e876081d"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Levy of contribution</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8cf91045-6c69-43ab-a420-07546ca73c2c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In respect of declared land, there shall be
charged, levied, collected and paid in accordance with the provisions of the
Principal Act and at the times and in the manner therein provided:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7da3d635-9c72-49a2-9937-7185a1309576" id="sec.2-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">development contribution calculated at the rate
of thirty per centum of the leviable increase in the price of the land,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2b6a071b-2b79-47a8-9810-d805253c60d0" id="sec.2-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">development contribution calculated at the rate
of thirty per centum of the leviable increase in the value of the
land.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3d1898f5-817b-4696-9a85-836febccf490"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where, on assessment in accordance with the
Principal Act, the amount of contribution payable would, but for this
subsection, be:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0380b5b6-255d-4d3e-9d9c-b58cbb130f34" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">less than one dollar, no contribution is payable,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b58c7864-f83e-4ba4-8020-c43224626f93" id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an amount consisting of a number of dollars and a
number of cents:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1649034e-2087-40c3-8b59-17cfb930babe"
id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the number of cents is less than
fifty&#8212;the number of cents shall be disregarded, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_20f0d505-fb24-462b-9164-a94a63d00e22"
id="sec.2-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the number of cents is fifty or more&#8212;the
number of cents shall be disregarded and the amount of the contribution
payable shall be that number of dollars increased by an amount of one
dollar.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</content>


